    {
      "id": "F9dlWasSV7d4ulLyBa19V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200.76095182606878,
      "y": 701.9296875,
      "width": 624.7991333007812,
      "height": 440,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 670943476,
      "version": 648,
      "versionNonce": 1067457868,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791107146725,
      "created": 1791099059276,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requiremsnts\n- Users click an ad and get redirected to the advertiser's website\n- Adveitisers can query click metrics over time w/1 minute granularity.\n\n-- out of scope ---\n- Ad targetting and serving\n- Cross device tracking\n- Integration with offline channels\n\n\nNon functional requirements\n- Scalable to support peak 10K CPS\n- Low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- Fault tolerance\n- Data integrity\n- As realtime as possible\n- Idenpotency of ad clicks\n\n--- Out of scope ----\n- spam detection\n- Demographic profiling\n- Conversion tracking ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requiremsnts\n- Users click an ad and get redirected to the advertiser's website\n- Adveitisers can query click metrics over time w/1 minute granularity.\n\n-- out of scope ---\n- Ad targetting and serving\n- Cross device tracking\n- Integration with offline channels\n\n\nNon functional requirements\n- Scalable to support peak 10K CPS\n- Low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- Fault tolerance\n- Data integrity\n- As realtime as possible\n- Idenpotency of ad clicks\n\n--- Out of scope ----\n- spam detection\n- Demographic profiling\n- Conversion tracking ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SZQhHaXpnDqCvT61O3Rxl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 197.76095182606878,
      "y": 1169.23828125,
      "width": 299.1995849609375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
