      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791107146725,
      "created": 1791105647890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "limit 1000 records/s\n- Shard by adId",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "limit 1000 records/s\n- Shard by adId",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "V1MDOsvGoRFZm5eRkGEgY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2734.8222933104194,
      "y": 3456.1370683645227,
      "width": 265.0882174085764,
      "height": 51.518826254422784,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1978729292,
      "version": 376,
      "versionNonce": 1804761036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791107146725,
      "created": 1791105836869,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Can scale horizontally, each flink\ncluster read data from particular\nshard from kenisis/kafka",
      "fontSize": 13.738353667846077,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Can scale horizontally, each flink cluster read data from particular shard from kenisis/kafka",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XCErBxuW2B4DW5u7coGYH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 178.1496816639545,
      "y": 1606.9391196940792,
      "width": 457.599365234375,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 507486156,
      "version": 222,
      "versionNonce": 210345548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791107146725,
      "created": 1791105925856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Main scaling points\n\n- Horizontal scalling\n- Using OLAP DB for heavy read aggregator operations\n- Flink instead of Spark jobs\n- Solve Hot shard issue ( with celebrity problem )",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Main scaling points\n\n- Horizontal scalling\n- Using OLAP DB for heavy read aggregator operations\n- Flink instead of Spark jobs\n- Solve Hot shard issue ( with celebrity problem )",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qWi7w5gpJZcJXYT3AOq_s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1276.5063428486883,
      "y": 3728.912347337695,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1765834188,
      "version": 481,
      "versionNonce": 14152908,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791107146725,
      "created": 1791106174201,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hot shards\n- Solve it with celebrity problem\n- Create more partitions from that single shard\n- Add numbers 1..N in primaryKey(ShardKey)\n- AddId:0-N\n- Click processor service partition it and put it into right shard\n- Here Flink will have to read from multiple shard as it is in-memory so will not create\nany issue. ( Possible to scale )\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hot shards\n- Solve it with celebrity problem\n- Create more partitions from that single shard\n- Add numbers 1..N in primaryKey(ShardKey)\n- AddId:0-N\n- Click processor service partition it and put it into right shard\n- Here Flink will have to read from multiple shard as it is in-memory so will not create any issue. ( Possible to scale )\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kVpmGhMXu_Qf4jAiYIMjo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1284.261718062386,
      "y": 3931.4071316683535,
      "width": 712.7990112304688,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
